      "statement": "`serverCertificates` takes `ALLOW`, `BLOCK` or `PASS_THRU` under `decryptSubActions`, but only `ALLOW` or `BLOCK` under `doNotDecryptSubActions`. The console's Pass Through is the token `PASS_THRU`, so a filter on `PASSTHROUGH` never matches.",
      "tier": "A",
